## Chronological validation and model selection

Never use an ordinary random train/test split as the primary evaluation. Queue rules, applicant behavior, and withdrawal rates change over time.

Use:

- Development/training cohorts: 2016–2020
- Later holdout cohorts: 2021–2022

If the refreshed data supports a better set of mature cohorts, use a rolling-origin split while preserving the principle that every validation year occurs after its training years. Explain any change.

For each candidate report:

